{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 6, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant energy of the country. Tokyo, with its towering skyscrapers and bustling streets, was a sensory overload in the best possible way. I spent hours exploring the city's many neighborhoods, from the neon-lit streets of Shinjuku to the serene gardens of the Imperial Palace.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi of my life. I was also fascinated by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that Japan embodies. From ancient temples and shrines to cutting-edge technology and innovation, Japan seamlessly blends old and new.\n\nA highlight of my trip was a visit to the iconic Fushimi Inari shrine in Kyoto, famous for its thousands of vermilion torii gates that form a tunnel up the mountain. The hike was challenging, but the breathtaking views and serene atmosphere made it well worth the effort.\n\nAs I reflect on my time in Japan, I am struck by the country's warm hospitality and attention to detail. From the polite service to the exquisite cuisine, every aspect of my trip was carefully considered and executed. Japan is a country that will leave you in awe, and I can't wait to return.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.46528711915016174}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.00416210200637579}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20399625599384308}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5810136795043945}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.00042775063775479794}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.0003357561945449561}, {"to